Package: cercano
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: cercano-agent (>= @VERSION@), cercano-cli (>= @VERSION@)
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/cercano-ai/Cercano
Description: agent and terminal client for Cercano, installs both
 Cercano is a free and open agent and harness: use frontier providers through
 a subscription sign-in or API key, run open-weight models, or combine them,
 with routing, delegation and context management built in.
 .
 This convenience package installs cercano-agent and cercano-cli. It owns no
 commands itself.
 .
 Experimental and unsigned.
